# Copy to .env and fill in only what you actually need.
#
# The lab needs NO key to run. Every skill, every agent and all 3 projects work
# offline on the bundled material. This file exists for the case where somebody
# wires their agent to an outside source during the build, and it is the right
# place for that key: .env is git-ignored, so nothing lands in the repository.
#
# Rule for the room: a key never goes in the chat, never in a source file, and
# never in a prompt. It goes here.

# Example, if an agent you build needs web search through a paid provider.
# TAVILY_API_KEY=
